aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[115410,155556,781978,3850602,3917817],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"在崩坏星穹铁道游戏里，那刻夏作为理性的黄金裔，在有神仙皇帝的世界里相信没有神谕，并且最终解开了逐火之旅的真相。然而在3.2版本主线剧情的最后，阿格莱雅却似乎出乎意料地在挽留、认可那刻夏，并且同意让那刻夏共鸣她的火种，并且那刻夏在大会上表演时称呼阿格莱雅为亲爱的。我们该如何评价这种情感？"},"attached_info":"CkkIhfr8pNLXsJAqEAMaCTExNDUzMDkwOCCf+/2/BjAAOB1AFnITMTg5NTg5NzA4MDAzNzM0MzY2MHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"64 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-957e64d5d82b34f4df8ba6165cffb254_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"23_1744903235.440881","card_id":"Q_396485576","target":{"id":396485576,"title":"如果把桥都拆了，图们江可否被疏浚至具备航运价值？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/396485576","type":"question","created":1590119806,"answer_count":89,"follower_count":242,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[3947,5093,100762],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"不知何时起，网上就开始流传“图们江出海口朝俄边界一座桥，锁死吉林出海口”的段子。桥确实是存在的，甚至中国人自己在图们江上上下下也修了不少的矮桥： 图们江本身江太小、水太浅，且枯水期和洪水期变化很大，哪怕这些桥从未存在，航运价值也几乎为零。那么，如果把桥拆了或者抬高，再对其进行疏浚，图们江是否可以获得航运价值？即便是几百箱的支线集装箱船走不了，能走几百吨的内河货船也行啊？"},"attached_info":"Cj8Ihfr8pNLXsJAqEAMaCDUwMzg3Mzg2IP6anfYFMAA48gFAF3IJMzk2NDg1NTc2eACqAQliaWxsYm9hcmTSAQA=","detail_text":"59 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pica.zhimg.com/80/v2-8f5b4a74f95b5e8222767766ef87a9ed_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"24_1744903235.443255","card_id":"Q_1893720855944614438","target":{"id":1893720855944614400,"title":"青春期应该如何补钙更能抓住长高黄金期？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1893720855944614438","type":"question","created":1744278235,"answer_count":189,"follower_count":415,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zh